==Trivia==
*This card's effect is identical to that of {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Wicke|127}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
**{{TCG|Iono}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Iono]] is the [[Gym Leader]] of the [[Levincia Gym]] in [[Paldea]]. The Levincia Gym's battle court is featured in both of the standard prints' illustrations.
*Both of this card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Iono|185}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.

